    <section class="hkex-2col" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
    
            <div class="hkex-wrapper">
                
                            <div class="hkex-2col__left hkex-2col__left--text">
                                

                                <h3 style="color: unset; font-size: 18px"></h3>
                                
                                <div class="section_title small"><span>1. HKEX is the preferred destination for Southeast Asian companies choosing an overseas IPO.<br />
</span></div>
                                <div class="hkex-redline-break"></div>
                                
                                    <div class="whylist-landing-richtext">

                                        

                                        

                                        <div style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.6em;"><p><span>88 of the 219 Southeast Asian companies listing overseas between 2014 and 2025 chose HKEX, compared with 73 listing on North American exchanges, 40 choosing other Asia-Pacific exchanges,&nbsp; and 18 floating on European exchanges.</span></p></div>
                                        
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                
                                <div class="hkex-2col__right hkex-2col__img-holder">

                                    
                                    <div class="hkex-2col__img " style="background-image: url(/-/media/HKEX_Common/Market/Why-List-in-HK/SEA-Hub/Asean-Companies--Overseas-Listing-by-Destination_20142025_v6.png);"></div>
                                    
