                                <div style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.6em;"><p>HKEX&rsquo;s Stock Connect programme&nbsp;stands out as the only channel available for global issuers to access capital from Mainland China. <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Through Southbound Stock Connect,&nbsp;</span>HKEX offers a unique opportunity for IPO hopefuls to tap both international and Mainland Chinese capital.</p></div>
                                
